{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"Y\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"维持尊严主要表现为抽象的自我控制、守分寸和稳住情绪，缺少与旧日生活之间具体而明确的行动冲突。\",\n    \"不少段落转而围绕不安、惊惧、疲惫、熟悉感和情绪起伏展开，这些状态有时没有明确落在尊严与归属的拉扯上。\",\n    \"对旧日的怀念多次表现为零碎的温暖、亲切感或对过去自己的怀念，旧日生活本身的具体吸引力不够突出。\",\n    \"后段逐渐转向自我肯定和重新接管生活，中心冲突虽最终得到整合，但前面相当一部分内容更像泛化的心理复原过程。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"对旧日生活及归属的怀念较多集中在有人陪伴、被当作自己人和不必独自面对困难，容易把更广泛的旧日生活归属收窄为人际亲近与陪伴需求。\",\n    \"是否回去、以后会不会孤单一度成为非常突出的具体问题，略微替代了维持尊严与怀念旧日生活之间更广义的持续拉扯。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"Y反复让对旧日亲近生活的怀念与不愿再忍受委屈、坚持尊严的选择相互触发和制约，两者始终缠在一起变化。X虽然也包含两方面，但较多篇幅转向泛化的情绪波动与自我调适，中心事件的针对性和连贯性较弱。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "653716ed-17ac-441a-8ba5-9746081edeaf", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T075738944071Z", "elapsed_seconds": 22.562, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T07:58:01.515047+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "754fbf863f7137f42b003ff456eeeaeea5479d0800428ed49329b344685ac72b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "